      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Hi @{62df041e4a256544ac8c30c6|full_name}! Thank you for the report.\n\nWhat's your camera's Camera Near Distance setting? Forced Mode may cause the issues you're describing.\n\n> [Forced Mode] Camera near distance will always be 1mm. WARNING: This can result in significant render issues in worlds with a high view distance. Resets on world change. \n\nIf you notice the issue regardless of your near clip setting, and it only occurs in one world, please report the issue to the world creator.",
